{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的纵向交替和感受词按时出现，在短时段里不如X的固定双栏方便随时扫读，容易错过个别提示。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏和静态短词更方便观众随时扫一眼，但Y用【】突出每段叙事支点，又通过感受与话语交替，让人物的念头和音乐变化更容易对应。尤其在人物为什么怀念、为什么犹豫、为什么不愿回头这些关键问题上，Y交代得更具体，前后因果也更清楚。Y的音乐感受不只是情绪标签，还有音型、节奏、身体反应和心理变化的细节，因此整体感染力和细腻程度更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2b515068-68f1-4370-b500-649c3c6d1017", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T011753602660Z", "elapsed_seconds": 93.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:19:27.526654+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c2134a11bdbc59b33a82772c3a95844075c4be3afb56a12b734a0d2481164867", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa